    <item>
      <title>泵浦系統維護與保固要點</title>
      <link>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-assoma/zh-tw/articles/pump-system-maintenance/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-assoma/zh-tw/articles/pump-system-maintenance/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;泵浦系統維護與保固的重要性 
    &lt;div id=&#34;泵浦系統維護與保固的重要性&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%e6%b3%b5%e6%b5%a6%e7%b3%bb%e7%b5%b1%e7%b6%ad%e8%ad%b7%e8%88%87%e4%bf%9d%e5%9b%ba%e7%9a%84%e9%87%8d%e8%a6%81%e6%80%a7&#34; aria-label=&#34;定位點&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
